{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"740083483405189163","content":"@everyone \nHome brew rules for this:\n\n-There will be instant death! Some things will instantly kill you! I am not holding back. \nHowever if you die you will immediately be plopped back to safety. With none of your stuff. Your stuff will be where you died, so you can recollect it. This will create consequences for your actions; but still allow the game to continue\n\n-No PVP, I don’t want the game slowed down.\nHowever that doesn’t mean you can’t “accidentally” cause someone’s death...\n\n-if combat does engage, and you do not instantly tell me what you are doing you will be skipped. I don’t mean to be rude, but I can’t slow down with how many people there are hoping onto this\n\n-if you go down in combat it is an instant death. You will be plopped back into the game without your stuff, just like the first rule says. This allows you to keep going without waisting your time rolling death saves\n\n-no stealing from other players. If you don’t like your stuff you had your chance :p there MAY be loot that is found in game.","created_at":"2020-08-04T05:51:38.731000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-04T05:59:07.180000Z","id":"740084516047028234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
